### Third-Party Data Attributions & Compliance

1. **Copernicus Sentinel Data:**
   Contains modified Copernicus Sentinel data (2026). Processed by S.T.R.A.N.D.
   Distributed in accordance with the Copernicus Open Access Hub terms of use.

2. **Copernicus Digital Elevation Model (GLO-30):**
   Produced using Copernicus WorldDEM-30 © DLR e.V. 2010–2014 and © Airbus Defence
   and Space GmbH 2014–2018 provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA;
   all rights reserved.

3. **OpenStreetMap Data:**
   Map data © OpenStreetMap contributors, licensed under the Open Data Commons
   Open Database License (ODbL) by the OpenStreetMap Foundation (OSMF).
   https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright

4. **Copernicus Emergency Management Service (EMS):**
   Rapid Mapping activation EMSR927 data used strictly as an offline reference benchmark.
